laprdus (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Laprdus 2.0.
  * New formant voices synthesized by rule: Zvonko (Croatian), Stojan (Serbian)
    and Mirsad (Bosnian), the default voice of each language.
  * Library SONAME bumped to liblaprdus.so.2.

